":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7-beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1 - macOS Tahoe (26.4.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (14 threads) - 36.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n(I was in doubt over whether this should be a proposal or a bug report... but I ended up concluding that the current behavior _breaks_ what I think is _the general expectation_ of this functionality, so a bug report seemed more fitting.)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112985 introduced 'Paste as Replacement' and it was opted to only re-apply the position, and not the other transform properties: rotation and scale (and skew, but... does anyone ever use that lol) – even though it is expected that they would as the position **is** re-applied. Why only position and not the entire transform, as would make more sense?\n\nIn our project (Hidden Folks 2), we've found ourselves relying regularly on the replace option, but because most of our objects are rotated and scaled, we find ourselves having to do a lot of extra work after each paste to re-apply the rotation and scale:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e1fd06f-968a-4b1c-996b-b9400c69b1f9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse 'Paste as Replacement' on a node deriving from Node2D or Node3D and see how only the position is retained / re-applied, but none of the other properties.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119307/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}